:: Read me [guide] {"position":"100,100","size":"100,100"}
This is Rydan's story map, built from Feras's story bible (docs/story/bible.md, 2026-10-26).
Only Rydan is playable for now; Bilqis, Roya, Zayd and the rest are story characters.

One passage = one scene, beat, character, place or question.
Arrows = what leads to what: write [[Passage name]] inside a passage to link it.

Colours (status tags):
- yellow "idea": a thought, nothing decided
- blue "draft": written, still changing (the bible's WORKING PROPOSAL)
- green "locked": decided; Claude builds from it (the bible's CONFIRMED)
- red "check": the bible and an earlier decision disagree; pick one

Other tags, no colour: scene, character, place, question, and ch0, ch1, ch2... for the chapter.

Rearrange, rename, add and delete freely. When you are done, close Twine and tell Claude "pull the story".

